    "Enter the credentials for your [LLU follower account](https://www.librelinkup.com/) and press the Connect button. Credentials will be sent automatically to watch app if it is installed.\n[TROUBLE? TAP TO OPEN HELP](https://github.com/poml88/FLwatch?tab=readme-ov-file#usage)" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Geben Sie die Zugangsdaten für Ihr [LLU Follower Konto](https://www.librelinkup.com/) ein und drücken Sie \"Verbinden\". Zugangsdaten werden automatisch an die Watch App gesendet, falls diese installiert ist.\n[PROBLEME? TIPPEN UM HILFE ZU ÖFFNEN](https://github.com/poml88/FLwatch?tab=readme-ov-file#usage)"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Introduzca las credenciales de su [cuenta de seguidor de LLU](https://www.librelinkup.com/) y pulse el botón Conectar. Las credenciales se enviarán automáticamente a la aplicación del reloj si está instalada.\n[¿PROBLEMAS? PULSE PARA ABRIR LA AYUDA](https://github.com/poml88/FLwatch?tab=readme-ov-file#usage)"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saisissez les identifiants de votre [compte LLU follower](https://www.librelinkup.com/) et appuyez sur le bouton Connecter. Les identifiants seront automatiquement envoyés à l'application Watch si elle est installée.\n[PROBLÈME ? APPUYEZ POUR OUVRIR L'AIDE](https://github.com/poml88/FLwatch?tab=readme-ov-file#usage)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[LLUフォロワーアカウント](https://www.librelinkup.com/)の認証情報を入力し、接続ボタンを押してください。アプリがインストールされている場合、認証情報は自動的にウォッチアプリに送信されます。\n[トラブル？タップしてヘルプを開く](https://github.com/poml88/FLwatch?tab=readme-ov-file#usage)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "输入您的 [LLU 追踪账户](https://www.librelinkup.com/) 凭据并点击“连接”按钮。若已安装手表应用，凭据将自动发送至该应用。\n[遇到问题？点击打开帮助](https://github.com/poml88/FLwatch?tab=readme-ov-file#usage)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the credentials for your [LLU follower account](https://www.librelinkup.com/) and press the Connect button. Credentials will be sent automatically to watch app if it is installed.\n[TROUBLE? TAP TO OPEN HELP](https://poml88.github.io/FLwatch/)" : {
